{"reviews":[{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-0","r":5.0,"t":"They work great for that","x":"These are LONG teeth combs, NOT side combs, They are for holding Buns and French Rolls in place. They work great for that.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-1","r":5.0,"t":"Love these","x":"I have been using this style combs for about a decade and absolutely love them.  I do not like to have a lot of different holders in my hair.  You know, when you need an up-do and it ends up being a rubber band, a barrette and four bobby pins.  For me it is too much.  And not only to put them in, but especially to take them out at the end of the day.  Well, this comb can hold shoulder length and longer hair in a high knot all by itself.  I do not use it for french twist, but rather twist hair in","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-2","r":5.0,"t":"These clips are a very good size for longer hair","x":"These clips are a very good size for longer hair.  My daughter's hair is wavy, thick, and to her upper back.  I was able to throw her hair into a french twist in about one minute because with the size of this clip and the space between the tines it held perfectly.  One clip was enough to fasten the entire twist so now instead of her hair getting into what she is drawing, it's held back and secure.  These work well enough that I don't think I will even need to bobby pin her for dance class.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-3","r":5.0,"t":"Easy and reliable","x":"I am terrible at doing my hair - it never stays the way I want it to, nothing is easy for me to do with it.  So I ordered these, expecting to have to practice for a couple months before I could get an adequate french twist for a cosplay outfit.  Tonight I did a rough trial run... and one application of the comb to my messy attempt and it came together perfectly.  Easy to use, holds perfectly - all on the first try!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-4","r":4.0,"t":"Brown combs are flimsy","x":"The black ones work awesome but the brown ones aren't made as well and the teeth snap right off. I wish they would sell just the black ones in this set. I have super thick hair past my shoulders and 1 comb holds it all up.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-5","r":2.0,"t":"You Don\u2019t Need This Many","x":"They are flimsy and take up space. The plastic makes them slick, so unless your hair is naturally curly do not buy.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-6","r":5.0,"t":"French twist Combs","x":"Another reviewer said these were flimsy and cheap but I disagree. They're very sturdy. I broke one when I stepped on it with a pair of hard soled shoes but anything would have broken under those conditions. These are a great bargain for the money","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-7","r":1.0,"t":"Very Weak Product","x":"I used these one. They fell apart day one. My hair is soft curly so it wasn't like it was too tough to get through my hair.  It was disappointing. Daaaay one. I wouldn't recommend at all. Save your coins.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-8","r":5.0,"t":"I like them","x":"For  the price I think these are great.. I ordered another set for my daughter I have long rather thick hair I haven\u2019t broken one yet also they hold my hair..","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-9","r":2.0,"t":"Cheaply made, but they serve my purpose. One ...","x":"Cheaply made, but they serve my purpose. One has already broken, but thankfully there are more in the set.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-10","r":5.0,"t":"Quick updo","x":"As a server, these are great to have nearby as it takes me just a few minutes to roll my hair into itself and these combs makes things so much easier. I have noticed that if my hair is too clean, that they can start to come out, but that's not a big problem, I just redo it and go on my way.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-11","r":5.0,"t":"Just right","x":"I have fine hair but lots of it, it fall just past my shoulders. I can easily twist it up and hold it in place all day with one of these combs. None have broken, I stash them all over the house so they are handy anytime my hair gets in my way.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-12","r":4.0,"t":"Good amount","x":"Great value for what you're paying for.  The only downside is that one of the brown combs already broke in the middle, but luckily there are lots more so losing one isn't a big deal!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-13","r":5.0,"t":"Versatile and works with fine straight hair","x":"I love these combs! I have medium length fine hair cut in layers and I have found multiple ways to put my hair up with these and keep all my hair in place even while I\u2019m gardening!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-14","r":5.0,"t":"A French Twist necessity!","x":"For anyone that needs combs for a French twist, these are perfect! They\u2019re nearly impossible to find in stores and the price is awesome.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-15","r":4.0,"t":"Could be a little more sturdy, but for the price I can't complain","x":"Could be a little more sturdy, but for the price I can't complain.  The combs tend to break when I push them into my French twist.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-16","r":5.0,"t":"Nice!","x":"I spent so many years trying to find these and now I got them and they are just like I remember!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-17","r":5.0,"t":"Good quality, great price","x":"Got these for my sister who\u2019s always putting her hair in a French twist. Can\u2019t beat the price!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-18","r":5.0,"t":"These are great! I had been looking for them and finally ...","x":"These are great!  I had been looking for them and finally thought of ordering on Amazon.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-19","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"If you have thick hair they do not hold in place that well.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-20","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"The teeth on these combs break off\u200b easily.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-21","r":2.0,"t":"HUGE","x":"HUGE size, not for shoulder lenght hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-22","r":5.0,"t":"Superb hair gadget. Buy these now!","x":"These are hands down the very best hair comb holders I have ever come across in my life. I\u2019m 55 yrs old and have had long, hair for periods of time during my life. My hair now Is just past shoulder length. I don\u2019t want to cut my hair but am tired of pony tails. This comb is a super easy, steadfast way to make a neat chignon. It feels really secure which is wonderful. Exactly what I need. I gave 3 starts for sturdiness because one tine broke after being in my pocket for a short time, but at this ","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-23","r":5.0,"t":"Just what I need for my long heavy hair","x":"I've only been finding one comb for just as much as this set.  Also, most combs are too short to hold up my long heavy hair.  These are nice and long.  I need quite a few to do the job.  And it would be expensive to buy one comb at a time or only just a few as so many combs are sold.  I am really satisfied with these long, sturdy combs and the price for so many.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B01LXTUFBT-24","r":3.0,"t":"Not the best quality","x":"I love this style of comb. They generally hold my hair most of the day. Unfortunately, two out of 10 combs broke after only a few uses. I haven't used them all, but I can already see they will not last long. Still, not too bad for the price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find these combs effective for holding up-dos like French twists and buns, especially for longer or thicker hair.","cites":[1,3,4,9,11,12,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers consider them a good value, noting the low price and that the set includes plenty of combs.","cites":[7,9,13,15]},{"text":"A recurring complaint is that the combs are flimsy or cheaply made, with some breaking or falling apart.","cites":[5,6,8,10,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers specifically note that the brown combs are weaker and break more easily than the black ones.","cites":[5,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention that the combs can slip out of very clean or fine straight hair.","cites":[6,11]}]},"qa":[]}